            <lg xml:id="m-def3095f-bd63-4128-a974-ec70611378b4">
              <l xml:id="m-6a931e6c-5a49-4e48-b037-15de561c9c12" facs="#m-d40d727d-4214-432c-84fc-a7edd246f98a" label="ambiguous">December 8.</l><l xml:id="m-a6672b10-23e6-4e99-9de4-d9299764d609" facs="#m-65c56e46-2d2b-497e-bf43-79a3584673d6" label="ambiguous">1310</l><l xml:id="m-fe10186f-c936-4928-bb07-d43a263b5f77" facs="#m-d10b7b60-0969-4ce8-bcf9-4913af1319b4" label="lyrics-like">mu-li- é¬</l><l xml:id="m-49f70826-4c3b-4140-b42e-8a1a7be60d77" facs="#m-56300166-1e19-4b4c-9fe8-f9ee4f4dbb65" label="ambiguous">ribus,</l><l xml:id="m-33613235-076c-4faa-ba7f-0e7f8b105c62" facs="#m-753a6e0e-78f8-4031-a19f-f7eb9ae50621" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-104baef0-4c71-40cb-9576-f705e13fafdd" facs="#m-0e5e464f-9cea-4d06-8fd2-3e246b4fe17d" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-419f4b92-25e9-4f3d-978f-3a064fd9ff4c" facs="#m-681c542b-56bb-4356-a3a4-4d011da2a5ed" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-415633ec-1662-4558-9372-915b71f44ee0" facs="#m-aff9283c-9fab-4132-98d6-3878a8de2694" label="lyrics-like">YAlutárem hóstiam, quam in so-[veniénte, ab omni labe immúnem</l><l xml:id="m-94035d47-a282-4311-99b9-52de893de02b" facs="#m-81614a62-885e-4555-9ac7-0fa8b8360cf5" label="lyrics-like">O lemnitáte Immaculâtae Conce¬</l><l xml:id="m-9506a52a-1675-484c-84f9-188600e97081" facs="#m-f7fd5bdb-023e-444f-8f2e-f03dec5d0176" label="lyrics-like">profitémur; ita ejus intercessióne</l><l xml:id="m-9f85f875-4476-4c19-9cae-fa40e44f8231" facs="#m-970ae3a5-63cd-4b63-aa23-afe14feeec30" label="lyrics-like">a culpis ómnibus liberémur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-e9712aa1-08a1-45cd-8729-9d503689220e" facs="#m-b59ea289-bc08-4b77-905c-2c40c02c9d7b" label="lyrics-like">ptiónis beátae Virginis Mariae tibi</l><l xml:id="m-aed605eb-99c6-4338-a597-e2b94d65c35d" facs="#m-45b16e64-918e-4536-9afa-a69d1cdcddd5" label="lyrics-like">Dómine offérimus, súscipe et prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-fbc8f787-c372-48e5-b843-39f3ac46dc3a" facs="#m-577b37d1-cfa6-46f9-a6e5-3e000ec889ff" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b54ce3e4-fc07-4ad5-88ac-3232b0777fac" facs="#m-88c2a868-85a2-4281-9450-a53314dd21a3" label="lyrics-like">sta:ut sicut illam, tua grátia prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-4df8fd49-cbbb-429f-9b47-a7e2556909cd" facs="#m-0cc3f82c-0324-43ae-bd32-0e46d05db5c1" label="lyrics-like">Preface of the Blessed Virgin. Et te in Conceptióne Immaculáta. p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-78203334-4e7c-4f69-a165-9cf383d067d8" facs="#m-09dd7c0f-da60-4671-a412-a802b1eeb53a" label="ambiguous">comm.f</l><l xml:id="m-b4d32720-c899-4cba-b310-c98b5457dbc7" facs="#m-5d543775-578e-42fb-a348-c113deb4159a" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-f88a71c9-aeac-4d07-8aea-93ed1cb738b2" facs="#m-36f135c5-06bd-48b3-a0cb-fdc1d46779ba" label="lyrics-like">Lo-ri-6́- sa “dí-cta sunt de te, Ma-rí¬a</l><l xml:id="m-57d64c8d-41c2-4b89-aee7-95a6f99c9f4d" facs="#m-09c20b4f-10b6-441e-8b87-795341490b53" label="lyrics-like">qui-a fécit tí-bi má-gna qui pót- ens est.</l><l xml:id="m-263b4d93-da2a-4be9-80ac-69ae16a22c6c" facs="#m-85e31b24-8330-4a5f-88f7-5e9766c2118f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-cc9141ae-ca84-4c1a-8741-2cf6b80f4652" facs="#m-7945743d-56d5-4839-9436-aaec707971e1" label="lyrics-like">NAcraménta quae súmpsimus, qua Immaculátam beátae Mariae</l><l xml:id="m-150306a3-fa7e-4d18-9e34-162644891b2e" facs="#m-d55eb68e-a836-49f3-a641-8b8cfc0e6fd6" label="lyrics-like">O Dómine Deus noster, islius in</l><l xml:id="m-8607fe3a-acbd-4076-bccd-c4e13f75b7ea" facs="#m-704178d9-c28c-4d73-911d-fdcb23a7ddb0" label="lyrics-like">Conceptiónem singuláriter praeser¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ee76ee8-002f-4787-8509-2dfec5912b7b" facs="#m-c3cffbac-a596-40d0-8445-31ffeb70f7c2" label="lyrics-like">nobis culpae vúlnera réparent; a l vásti. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7f0f66b1-0a94-4f17-be36-ef3c878b88a2" facs="#m-1443aea8-821c-4237-a214-392f937ad9d0" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-82598f5e-504a-463b-87c1-864446d4500e" facs="#m-164b94f8-3b93-4afa-873c-ffe4715df3a1" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Tu glória Jerúsalem. p. 1320.</l><l xml:id="m-23ae025c-79b5-4990-a8ad-bbb9500ed210" facs="#m-012bcace-6208-4790-a69f-3f8e947413e1" label="ambiguous">Erech. 44.</l><l xml:id="m-5093551b-26db-4e09-9dc5-d2c66ec8c4d1" facs="#m-2e4c1ca2-9118-4493-919e-1b7efa0d6357" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-519242d7-dd6f-4c29-aff1-0faac4c63860" facs="#m-bea5079e-d570-4cb9-8df9-02a4831999cc" label="lyrics-like">Orta haec clausa erit, non ape-Israel ingréssus est per eam : erit¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a3af50b-1329-46e4-9839-6f234d77e223" facs="#m-c1aa1603-9a84-4630-8f6a-41479922dcf3" label="lyrics-like">riétur, et vir non intrábit per que clausa Principi. * Princeps ipse</l><l xml:id="m-7689ecdc-c23b-4d9e-9f59-c38045409ed1" facs="#m-7da91655-d387-4df0-8018-89623a876132" label="lyrics-like">eam, 1 quóniam Dóminus Deus! sedébit in ea¬</l><l xml:id="m-7923943f-7cb3-495a-8ea2-4c96ae84e5e3" facs="#m-25b7e92d-9d34-4256-bdf1-0c2b5083d22d" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-b512420d-eba5-4a79-93d6-73bc8c234604" facs="#m-e3a06d3f-ef90-42c3-a4e2-def1a63cd477" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-8b256b8a-de41-4917-8b2a-6379a60f9252" facs="#m-d8c23eef-5577-4e50-abe4-26796071085a" label="lyrics-like">N hoc cognóvi “Quóni-am vo¬ lu-ísti me.</l><l xml:id="m-75ee6887-e142-4fd0-a47c-d6701166e1b1" facs="#m-47cbb2a3-2d6a-4d1e-a085-9d3486e65043" label="lyrics-like">V. Quóni-am non gaudébit in-imí-cus mé-us super me.</l><l xml:id="m-64be8634-8637-4c51-bfc4-9e79228fd0d9" facs="#m-500de394-7e65-4e63-b4ae-20b25b14b654" label="lyrics-like">Gló-i-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-671b20f4-a88c-483c-94f8-25c96b64db48" facs="#m-3ad7736f-8ba7-40c8-9b4a-2f0e92cecd59" label="lyrics-like">v. Exaltábo te Dómine, quóniam suscepísti me.</l><l xml:id="m-fba264be-4388-4630-a450-916e8974633b" facs="#m-3fa2693b-8fd5-4710-afe6-bf5e62b983d8" label="lyrics-like">H. Nec delectásti inimícos méos super me.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>